                "title": "Sandcast Bronze Diamond Knob with Arched Rosette",
                "description": "The dynamic shape of Emtek's Crystal Clear Diamond Knob is enhanced by the sandcast bronze arched rose, making this knobset a sparkling reminder of a time past. The Diamond Crystal Knob with Arched #1 Rose will fit doors 1-3/8 inch to 3 inch thick and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. The Sandcast Bronze Diamond Knob with Arched Rosette is available in dummy, passage, and privacy knobs. \r\n",
